# UP6b, correction C2: a withdrawn Remove is in no listing. Bob resumes and withdraws his own
# absence Remove; carol's stands. Past the call TTL the withdrawn row is neither voided nor re-driven
# (carol's is voided and re-driven), the freeze still holds for carol's alone, and a member commit
# that omits the withdrawn ref lands — GET /proposals never named it to the committer.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group call kind=call target=e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9e9 community=none creator=alice
join bob call via=external
sync alice
join carol call via=external
sync alice
sync bob
absent bob call
absent carol call
resume bob call withdrawn=1
advance_clock 35s
expect_425 send alice call carol's Remove still stands
sync alice
sync bob
sync carol
commit alice call
sync bob
send alice call carol is out and bob is in
expect_decrypts bob call carol is out and bob is in
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT resume carol call
